<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Stratos</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Stratus</span></b> , i, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Στράτος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A town of Acarnania</i>, <i>on the
				Achelous</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 1, 2,
				§ 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 36, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">38, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">43, 22,
			1</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Stratii</span></b> , ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Stratos</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 43,
				22, 7</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A river of Hyrcania</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 16,
				18, § 46</span></i> (al. Straor).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
